1
00:00:32,767 --> 00:00:34,769
(HEART BEATING STEADILY)

2
00:00:54,254 --> 00:00:56,456
(SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING)

3
00:01:02,931 --> 00:01:04,131
(GROANS SOFTLY)

4
00:01:25,085 --> 00:01:26,286
