Hey, J.

216
00:15:15,617 --> 00:15:20,087
That, my friend, that's the old
Aztec statue of Tlaloc.

217
00:15:20,120 --> 00:15:21,321
That's where the priests

218
00:15:21,355 --> 00:15:23,223
