Every day, a tourist wants me
to take them here.

222
00:15:29,564 --> 00:15:31,098
Very strange.

223
00:15:50,350 --> 00:15:51,586
Hey, J.

224
00:15:51,619 --> 00:15:52,620
You okay?

225
